{"articleNo":"105447","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=105447&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"* 미세먼지 주의보 발령*","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.04.16","hit":"2858","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014년 4월 16일 오전 11시 현재</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">구미시의 미세먼지 농도가 200㎍/㎥을</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">초과하여 『미세먼지 주의보』를 발령중이오니</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>외출과 야외활동을 자제하시고 마스크 착용 및</strong></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><strong>&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></strong></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>외출후 얼굴과 손을 깨끗이 씻기 바랍니다.</strong></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><strong>&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></strong></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2014. 4. 16. </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사무국(시설과)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
